            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/05ba1789126fb582589b7317314d432b.webp?t=1791239270\" width=596 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/cbe529c5aa9686f763f7b5077ab28500.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=300 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/cbe529c5aa9686f763f7b5077ab28500.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/63a5c3603fcc364385c4ba1239bffdaf.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=300 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/63a5c3603fcc364385c4ba1239bffdaf.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic in Puzzle World is an action-platformer. The dragon, Tide, jumps, slashes, bounces and blasts to save the 4 Puzzle Masters from their captors, so that Puzzle World can be saved from the robot invasion!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/1b1afd7c94c11c968a4c612a832a1f41.avif?t=1791239270\" width=616 height=129 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten densely packed levels </strong>of<strong> </strong>bumping, jumping and fire-blasting, each with novel mechanics to enjoy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rad boss fights!</strong> Fearsome robots stand in your way, with tons of attacks to tango with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? <strong>Rewind at any time</strong>, if you'd like! <i>(this difficulty feature can be toggled on/off</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun hats, color-palettes, challenge levels </strong>and more to unlock! Gotta use those gems for <i>something</i>, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fun story</strong> delivered through in-game cutscenes (which are effortlessly skippable)!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay any level</strong> and aim for S-Ranks and fastest times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/987d6ae96c677ed11977b77c6d2c54dd.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/987d6ae96c677ed11977b77c6d2c54dd.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/d1e72ff5a339dea67b20934872ad5770.avif?t=1791239270\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaboom! </strong>A fierce battle erupts at the foot of Shrine Mountain, and Tide's home is destroyed in the crossfire! He heads to the source of the commotion, encountering mysterious, hostile robots along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/9923405cbc8f81d24130918bead02ede.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=314 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/9923405cbc8f81d24130918bead02ede.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tide soon meets a rabbit, Violet, who explains that the ancient Puzzle Seal has been broken, allowing the robots to invade Puzzle World.  With her help, Tide sets out on an adventure to rescue the four Puzzle Masters from their robot captors. If the Puzzle Seal can be repaired, there may just be a chance to stop this Panic... <i>in Puzzle World!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/05ba1789126fb582589b7317314d432b.webp?t=1791239270\" width=596 height=32 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/05ba1789126fb582589b7317314d432b.webp?t=1791239270\" width=596 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/cbe529c5aa9686f763f7b5077ab28500.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=300 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/cbe529c5aa9686f763f7b5077ab28500.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/63a5c3603fcc364385c4ba1239bffdaf.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=300 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/63a5c3603fcc364385c4ba1239bffdaf.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic in Puzzle World is an action-platformer. The dragon, Tide, jumps, slashes, bounces and blasts to save the 4 Puzzle Masters from their captors, so that Puzzle World can be saved from the robot invasion!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/1b1afd7c94c11c968a4c612a832a1f41.avif?t=1791239270\" width=616 height=129 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten densely packed levels </strong>of<strong> </strong>bumping, jumping and fire-blasting, each with novel mechanics to enjoy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rad boss fights!</strong> Fearsome robots stand in your way, with tons of attacks to tango with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake? <strong>Rewind at any time</strong>, if you'd like! <i>(this difficulty feature can be toggled on/off</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun hats, color-palettes, challenge levels </strong>and more to unlock! Gotta use those gems for <i>something</i>, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fun story</strong> delivered through in-game cutscenes (which are effortlessly skippable)!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay any level</strong> and aim for S-Ranks and fastest times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/987d6ae96c677ed11977b77c6d2c54dd.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/987d6ae96c677ed11977b77c6d2c54dd.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/d1e72ff5a339dea67b20934872ad5770.avif?t=1791239270\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaboom! </strong>A fierce battle erupts at the foot of Shrine Mountain, and Tide's home is destroyed in the crossfire! He heads to the source of the commotion, encountering mysterious, hostile robots along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/9923405cbc8f81d24130918bead02ede.poster.avif?t=1791239270\" width=314 height=273 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/9923405cbc8f81d24130918bead02ede.webm?t=1791239270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tide soon meets a rabbit, Violet, who explains that the ancient Puzzle Seal has been broken, allowing the robots to invade Puzzle World.  With her help, Tide sets out on an adventure to rescue the four Puzzle Masters from their robot captors. If the Puzzle Seal can be repaired, there may just be a chance to stop this Panic... <i>in Puzzle World!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654860/extras/05ba1789126fb582589b7317314d432b.webp?t=1791239270\" width=596 height=32 /></span></p>",
